+</TD>
+<TD width=15% BGCOLOR=#FBF5EF>
+<B>28000</B>
+</TD>
+<TD width=35% BGCOLOR=#FBF5EF>
+<B>tXP: Minimum time after power down exit to any operation. DRAM related.</B>
+</TD>
+</TR>
+<TR valign="top">
+<TD width=15% BGCOLOR=#FBF5EF>
+<B>reg_ddrc_pad_pd</B>
+</TD>
+<TD width=15% BGCOLOR=#FBF5EF>
+<B>22:20</B>
+</TD>
+<TD width=10% BGCOLOR=#FBF5EF>
