+<B>70000000</B>
+</TD>
+<TD width=35% BGCOLOR=#FBF5EF>
+<B>tRCD - AL Minimum time from activate to read or write command to same bank Min value for this is 1. AL = Additive Latency. DRAM Related.</B>
+</TD>
+</TR>
+<TR valign="top">
