+</TD>
+<TD width=10% BGCOLOR=#FBF5EF>
+<B>0</B>
+</TD>
+<TD width=15% BGCOLOR=#FBF5EF>
+<B>0</B>
+</TD>
+<TD width=35% BGCOLOR=#FBF5EF>
+<B>When 1, disable counting the number of times the Read Data Capture FIFO has been reset when the FIFO was not empty.</B>
+</TD>
+</TR>
+<TR valign="top">
