+<B>0</B>
+</TD>
+<TD width=35% BGCOLOR=#FBF5EF>
+<B>Clear/reset for counter rdc_fifo_rst_err_cnt[3:0]. 0: no clear, 1: clear. Note: This is a synchronous dynamic signal that must have timing closed.</B>
+</TD>
+</TR>
+<TR valign="top">
+<TD width=15% BGCOLOR=#FBF5EF>
